 R←Test_SendEmail_40(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;parms;rc;msg;log;text
⍝ A server that offers AUTH PLAIN only
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 ∆SERVER.AuthMethods←'PLAIN'
 parms←∆NewMail'Created by SMTP''s ',⊃⎕SI
 (rc msg log text)←∆Send parms
 ∆SERVER.AuthMethods←'LOGIN PLAIN'
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 →T.PassesIf(,⊂'PLAIN' 'tester@aplteam.test' 'secret')≡∆SERVER.Logons

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
